 "lines": [
  [
   "P1",
   "Title: Equivalence of Definitions of Curvature/Whewell Form to Parametric Polar Form"
  ],
  [
   "P2",
   "{{TFAE|def = Curvature}}"
  ],
  [
   "P3",
   "=== [[Definition:Curvature/Whewell Form|Whewell Form]] ==="
  ],
  [
   "P4",
   "The '''[[Definition:Curvature|curvature]]''' $\\kappa$ of $C$ at a [[Definition:Point|point]] $P$ can be expressed in the form of a [[Definition:Whewell Equation|Whewell equation]] as:"
  ],
  [
   "P5",
   ":$\\kappa = \\dfrac {\\d \\psi} {\\d s}$"
  ],
  [
   "P6",
   "where:"
  ],
  [
   "P7",
   ":$\\psi$ is the [[Definition:Turning Angle|turning angle]] of $C$"
  ],
  [
   "P8",
   ":$s$ is the [[Definition:Arc Length|arc length]] of $C$."
  ],
  [
   "P9",
   "=== [[Definition:Curvature/Parametric Form/Polar|Parametric Polar Form]] ==="
  ],
  [
   "P10",
   "Let $C$ be embedded in a [[Definition:Polar Plane|polar plane]] and defined by the [[Definition:Parametric Equation|parametric equations]]:"
  ],
  [
   "P11",
   ":$\\begin{cases} r = \\map r t \\\\ \\theta = \\map \\theta t \\end{cases}$"
  ],
  [
   "P12",
   "The '''[[Definition:Curvature|curvature]]''' $\\kappa$ of $C$ at a [[Definition:Point|point]] $P = \\polar {r, \\theta}$ is given by:"
  ],
  [
   "P13",
   ":$\\kappa = \\dfrac {2 r'^2 \\theta' + r r' ' \\theta' + r r' \\theta' ' + r^2 \\theta'^3} {\\paren {r'^2 + \\paren {r \\theta'}^2}^{1/2} }$"
  ],
  [
   "P14",
   "where:"
  ],
  [
   "P15",
   ":$r' = \\dfrac {\\d r} {\\d t}$ is the [[Definition:Derivative|derivative]] of $r$ {{WRT|Differentiation}} $t$ at $P$"
  ],
  [
   "P16",
   ":$\\theta' = \\dfrac {\\d \\theta} {\\d t}$ is the [[Definition:Derivative|derivative]] of $\\theta$ {{WRT|Differentiation}} $t$ at $P$"
  ],
  [
   "P17",
   ":$r' '$ and $\\theta' '$ are the [[Definition:Second Derivative|second derivatives]] of $r$ and $y$ {{WRT|Differentiation}} $t$ at $P$."
  ],
  [
   1,
   "Consider the [[Definition:Curvature|curvature]] of a [[Definition:Curve|curve]] $C$ at a [[Definition:Point|point]] $P$ expressed as a [[Definition:Whewell Equation|Whewell equation]]:"
  ],
  [
   2,
   ""
  ],
  [
   3,
   ":$\\kappa = \\dfrac {\\d \\psi} {\\d s}$"
  ],
  [
   4,
   "where:"
  ],
  [
   5,
   ":$\\psi$ is the [[Definition:Turning Angle|turning angle]] of $C$"
  ],
  [
   6,
   ":$s$ is the [[Definition:Arc Length|arc length]] of $C$."
  ],
  [
   7,
   ""
  ],
  [
   8,
   "Let us consider $C$ expressed in [[Definition:Cartesian Plane|cartesian form]]:"
  ],
  [
   9,
   ""
  ],
  [
   10,
   "{{begin-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   11,
   "{{eqn | l = x"
  ],
  [
   12,
   "      | r = r \\cos \\theta"
  ],
  [
   13,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   14,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   15,
   "{{eqn | l = y"
  ],
  [
   16,
   "      | r = r \\sin \\theta"
  ],
  [
   17,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   18,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   19,
   "{{end-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   20,
   ""
  ],
  [
   21,
   "Then:"
  ],
  [
   22,
   ""
  ],
  [
   23,
   "{{begin-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   24,
   "{{eqn | l = \\dfrac {\\d x} {\\d t}"
  ],
  [
   25,
   "      | r = r' \\cos \\theta - r \\theta' \\sin \\theta"
  ],
  [
   26,
   "      | c = [[Chain Rule for Derivatives]], [[Derivative of Cosine Function]]"
  ],
  [
   27,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   28,
   "{{eqn | l = \\dfrac {\\d y} {\\d t}"
  ],
  [
   29,
   "      | r = r' \\sin \\theta + r \\theta' \\cos \\theta"
  ],
  [
   30,
   "      | c = [[Chain Rule for Derivatives]], [[Derivative of Sine Function]]"
  ],
  [
   31,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   32,
   "{{end-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   33,
   ""
  ],
  [
   34,
   "In [[Definition:Curvature/Whewell Form|Whewell form]]:"
  ],
  [
   35,
   ""
  ],
  [
   36,
   "{{begin-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   37,
   "{{eqn | l = \\tan \\psi"
  ],
  [
   38,
   "      | r = \\dfrac {y'} {x'}"
  ],
  [
   39,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   40,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   41,
   "{{eqn | l = s^2"
  ],
  [
   42,
   "      | r = x'^2 + y'^2"
  ],
  [
   43,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   44,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   45,
   "{{eqn | r = r^2 \\theta'^2 + r'2"
  ],
  [
   46,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   47,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   48,
   "{{eqn | ll= \\leadsto"
  ],
  [
   49,
   "      | l = \\map \\kappa t"
  ],
  [
   50,
   "      | r = \\dfrac {\\map \\arctan {\\dfrac {y'} {x'} }' } {s'}"
  ],
  [
   51,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   52,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   53,
   "{{end-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   54,
   ""
  ],
  [
   55,
   "Let:"
  ],
  [
   56,
   ""
  ],
  [
   57,
   "{{begin-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   58,
   "{{eqn | l = g"
  ],
  [
   59,
   "      | r = \\dfrac {y'} {x'}"
  ],
  [
   60,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   61,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   62,
   "{{eqn | r = \\tan \\psi"
  ],
  [
   63,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   64,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   65,
   "{{eqn | ll= \\leadsto"
  ],
  [
   66,
   "      | l = \\dfrac \\d {\\d \\psi}"
  ],
  [
   67,
   "      | r = \\dfrac {\\d g} {\\d \\psi}"
  ],
  [
   68,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   69,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   70,
   "{{eqn | ll= \\leadsto"
  ],
  [
   71,
   "      | l = \\dfrac {\\d \\psi} {\\d g}"
  ],
  [
   72,
   "      | r = \\dfrac 1 {1 + g^2}"
  ],
  [
   73,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   74,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   75,
   "{{eqn | r = \\dfrac {x'^2} {x'^2 + y'^2}"
  ],
  [
   76,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   77,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   78,
   "{{end-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   79,
   ""
  ],
  [
   80,
   "We have:"
  ],
  [
   81,
   ""
  ],
  [
   82,
   ":$\\map \\kappa t = \\dfrac {\\d \\psi} {\\d g} \\dfrac {\\d g} {\\d t} \\dfrac {\\d t} {\\d s}$"
  ],
  [
   83,
   ""
  ],
  [
   84,
   "Then:"
  ],
  [
   85,
   "{{begin-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   86,
   "{{eqn | l = \\dfrac {\\d t} {\\d s}"
  ],
  [
   87,
   "      | r = \\dfrac 1 {\\paren {x'^2 + y'^2}^{1/2} }"
  ],
  [
   88,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   89,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   90,
   "{{eqn | r = \\dfrac 1 {\\paren {r^2 \\theta'^2 + r'2}^{1/2} }"
  ],
  [
   91,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   92,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   93,
   "{{end-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   94,
   ""
  ],
  [
   95,
   "{{begin-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   96,
   "{{eqn | l = \\dfrac {\\d g} {\\d t}"
  ],
  [
   97,
   "      | r = \\map {\\dfrac \\d {\\d t} } {\\dfrac {y'} {x'} }"
  ],
  [
   98,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   99,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   100,
   "{{eqn | r = \\map {\\dfrac \\d {\\d t} } {\\dfrac {r' \\sin \\theta + r \\theta' \\cos \\theta} {r' \\cos \\theta - r \\theta' \\sin \\theta} }"
  ],
  [
   101,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   102,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   103,
   "{{eqn | r = \\dfrac {x' y' ' - y' x' '} {\\paren {x'}^2}"
  ],
  [
   104,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   105,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   106,
   "{{eqn | r = \\dfrac {2 r'^2 \\theta' + r r' \\theta' ' - r r' ' \\theta' + r^2 \\theta'^3} {\\paren {x'}^2}"
  ],
  [
   107,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   108,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   109,
   "{{eqn | r = \\dfrac {r' \\paren {r \\theta'}' - r r' ' \\theta' + \\paren {r'^2 + \\paren {r \\theta'}^2} \\theta'} {\\paren {x'}^2}"
  ],
  [
   110,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   111,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   112,
   "{{eqn | ll= \\leadsto"
  ],
  [
   113,
   "      | l = \\map \\kappa t"
  ],
  [
   114,
   "      | r = \\dfrac {x'^2} {s'^2} \\cdot \\dfrac {2 r'^2 \\theta' + r r' \\theta' ' - r r' ' \\theta' + r^2 \\theta'^3} {\\paren {x'}^2} \\cdot \\dfrac 1 {\\paren {r'^2 + \\paren {r \\theta'}^2}^{1/2} }"
  ],
  [
   115,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   116,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   117,
   "{{eqn | r = \\dfrac {2 r'^2 \\theta' + r r' ' \\theta' + r r' \\theta' ' + r^2 \\theta'^3} {\\paren {r'^2 + \\paren {r \\theta'}^2}^{1/2} }"
  ],
  [
   118,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   119,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   120,
   "{{end-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   121,
   "{{qed}}"
